{"data": [{"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:31:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116583968812441699"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/danitreweek/st…", "end": 150, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/danitreweek/status/2116510999662739593", "start": 127, "url": "https://t.co/TZEhCAgEK4"}]}, "id": "2116583968812441699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1809, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116510999662739593", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Dani believes it is persecution of Christian singles that bigger cereal boxes are cheaper per ounce than smaller cereal boxes. https://t.co/TZEhCAgEK4", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116583968812441699"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:25:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116491842577674522"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lizisamused/st…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lizisamused/status/2115982415659499785", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/R8OmXRNCSH"}]}, "id": "2116491842577674522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 6516, "like_count": 188, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115982415659499785", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "At the individual level, earlier sex probably doesn’t reduce male investment, true\n\nAt the societal level, a norm of earlier sex absolutely 1,000% for sure reduces male investment\n\nRight conduct consists in acting in a way which values the latter more than the former https://t.co/R8OmXRNCSH", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116491842577674522"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:00:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116485397832458639"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/col_a_buendia/…", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/col_a_buendia/status/21163