\nWHY do couples considering an extra kid want more bedrooms?\n\nBecause normative parenting actually is space intensive!\n\nParents want rooms *because rooms are a condition for kids*.\n\nIt’s not a selection effect! If no bedrooms exist the kids aren’t https://t.co/yVZ8sTYTti", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116335008759861680"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:54:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116317907244154951"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/skirtsnhose/st…", "end": 97, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/skirtsnhose/status/2116301529770868975", "start": 74, "url": "https://t.co/qTOpEtA10K"}]}, "id": "2116317907244154951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4066, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116301529770868975", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Chrysler Pacific is the only PHEV minivan…\n\nAnd was JUST DISCONTINUED https://t.co/qTOpEtA10K", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116317907244154951"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:54:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116302668859600951"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uCX0IUu9Mg", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2116302668859600951/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116299095996350464", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/uCX0IUu9Mg"}]}, "id": "2116302668859600951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 106, "impression_count": 59895, "like_count": 443, "quote_count": 16, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 52}, "text": "With SpaceX recently completing static fire tests on the ship and booster for the Starship Flight 15 mission, this week we spoke with the deputy manager of NASA's Human Landing System Program about some of SpaceX's critical milestones on the road to the Artemis 3 and 4 missions. https://t.co/uCX0IUu9Mg", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2116302668859600951"}, {"author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:17:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116278310095249881"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TMbAsJR5El", "end": 151, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2116278310095249881/video/1", "media_key": "7_2116278223843594240", "start": 128, "url": "https://t.co/TMbAsJR5El"}]}, "id": "2116278310095249881", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1647, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "NIST is no haunted house, but our science is pretty thrilling. These are just some of the robots at NIST’s Robot Test Facility. https://t.co/TMbAsJR5El", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2116278310095249881"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:20:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116263878807998722"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "America’s newest aerospace expo and air show – MAX POWER – is fast approaching, and NASA has announced key events beginning Friday, Nov. 6, and running", "display_url": "go.nasa.gov/4zjj9BD", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://go.nasa.gov/4zjj9BD", "images": [{"height": 1280, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116263885309153280/9vTAOjBs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116263885309153280/9vTAOjBs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "NASA Releases MAX POWER Key Events for Media, Participants - NASA", "unwound_url": "https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-releases-max-power-key-events-for-media-participants/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=1029491674", "url": "https://t.co/MdH9aY5LJ2"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/P18NboXze3", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2116263878807998722/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116263876366921728", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/P18NboXze3"}]}, "id": "2116263878807998722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 54, "impression_count": 340911, "like_count": 1373, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 71, "retweet_count": 168}, "text": "MAX POWER, America’s newest aerospace expo and air show, is just a week away!\n\nThis showcase will be packed with events—from aircraft flyovers to a chance to meet NASA astronauts and experts. Here's what you can expect: https://t.co/MdH9aY5LJ2 https://t.co/P18NboXze3", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2116263878807998722"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:49:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116256206922616862"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "After more than a year spent isolated and confined on a simulated M...", "display_url": "youtube.com/live/2MONMgAmX…", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://www.youtube.com/live/2MONMgAmXNU", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116256209799950336/wZINUCZw?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116256209799950336/wZINUCZw?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 205, "status": 200, "title": "CHAPEA Mission 2 Egress Event", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/live/2MONMgAmXNU", "url": "https://t.co/VBpDUHwPf2"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/DYtRTwLt8i", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2116256206922616862/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116256203709833216", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/DYtRTwLt8i"}]}, "id": "2116256206922616862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 83, "impression_count": 871709, "like_count": 1649, "quote_count": 30, "reply_count": 159, "retweet_count": 208}, "text": "After more than a year on a simulated Mars mission that will help us better prepare for future long-duration stays on the Moon and Mars, four crew members will \"return\" to Earth. Watch the crew exit live: https://t.co/VBpDUHwPf2 https://t.co/DYtRTwLt8i", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2116256206922616862"}, {"author_id": "6266609